WEBVTT


00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.240
hei what's up guys

00:00:01.241 --> 00:00:03.801
so hari ni kita nak buat menu orang Jawa iaitu sambal

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.680
taun

00:00:04.681 --> 00:00:07.281
yang ni sangatlah sedap buat untuk buka puasa nanti

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.400
cara dia senang je

00:00:08.401 --> 00:00:10.841
korang tumiskan 1 biji bawang merah dengan 6 ulas

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.520
bawang putih

00:00:11.521 --> 00:00:14.041
tambahkan segenggam ikan bilis tumis lama sikit

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.000
and then masukkan cili padi atau cili kampung

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.120
yang ni kena banyak kek

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:18.601
guna dalam 15 biji macam tu

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.481
lagi banyak lagi sedap

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.280
and then masukkan kerang aa

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.640
yang ni biasanya orang letak juga kulit lembu

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.680
tapi aku tak jumpa

00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:25.361
nak cari susah sikit

00:00:25.362 --> 00:00:27.095
so kita buat versi keranglah simple sikit

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.320
pas tu masukkan lengkuas dalam 4in

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.960
lengkuas kena banyak juga

00:00:30.961 --> 00:00:32.681
itu dia punya main ingredient dialah

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.840
and then masukkan 2 kotak kecil santan

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.080
kacau kacau and then korang tambahkan asam keping

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.960
and also garam dan juga serbuk perasa

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.880
kacau sampailah santan tu dah mula pekat

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.480
and dia macam jadi kuning sikit macam ni

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.640
and sedia untuk dihidang

00:00:43.641 --> 00:00:45.601
simple je tapi ya Allah sedap weh

00:00:45.602 --> 00:00:47.801
ni aku punya favorit of the year

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:48.840
memang sedap lauk ni

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.840
korang kena picit cili padi tu

00:00:50.841 --> 00:00:51.641
makan pedas pedas

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.560
dengan rasa lemak santan yang so fresh

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.040
daripada aroma kerang tu

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:56.441
memang sangat recommended

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.640
makan dengan nasi putih

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.360
yang ni memang korang kena buat betul betul pedas

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.960
baru dia kick dia punya cili padi tu
